        <activityName xml:lang="en">Deformation stroke, warm impact extrusion, steel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Deformation stroke, warm impact extrusion, steel
The reference for impact extrusion is 1 kg of metal formed by impact extrusion. As there is a large variation from factory to factory with regard to the LCI, it is advised that in case this dataset becomes important in the results, it has to be investigated further if the rough estimations made are applicable or not. ;
UUID: a5d45a62-a2ef-3e42-86d4-f73dd092b69f
This dataset encompasses the electricity consumption of the machine as well as common pre- and post treatments. Furthermore, machine as well as factory infrastructure and operation are considered as well. 
Location: Geographical coverage encompasses the industrialised countries.
Technology: Average technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a5d45a62-a2ef-3e42-86d4-f73dd092b69f.xml</text>
